Package: observideo
Version: 0.4.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Observideo maintainers
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libepoxy0
Description: Interval-based desktop video annotation
 Observideo scans local videos, applies reusable annotation templates, and
 exports annotations and query results as RFC 4180 CSV files.
